# Culminating Activity: track only the deliverables, not build or editor artefacts.
# Same allow-list approach as the whitepaper and results-and-discussion folders:
# ignore everything, then re-include only what belongs in the repository.
*
!*/
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!*.tex
!*.bib
!*.pdf

# Build and editor artefacts are never tracked, even where a rule above would allow them
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.bbl
*.blg
*.bcf
*.run.xml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
